The OpenAI Browser runtime is loaded from the user installation and is not redistributed.
Playwright MCP 0.0.83 (Microsoft Corporation), source commit f183dad4a52965583e3cc1d59b88cdc279e2e57d, is used as an optional internal browser connection backend under Apache-2.0. The official browser extension is installed separately and is not redistributed.
src/extension-compat.mjs adapts ExtensionProtocolV2 metadata routing and CRPage root-frame mapping from that commit. It applies a SHA256-guarded, process-local patch to the pinned backend; authorized target metadata is read without attaching a new Chrome browser target, and existing root frames whose identifiers differ from the browser target retain the correct session and coordinates. Other metadata-session commands are rejected. Microsoft Corporation's Apache-2.0 license is retained in the upstream dependency.
